The '''Krondor Necromancer''' is a [[Mob]] that spawns in the {{Zone|Mage Outpost}}.

== Spawning ==
The '''Krondor Necromancer''' can rarely spawn in the {{Zone|Mage Outpost}} on the [[Crimson Isle]].

