Killing a '''Krondor Necromancer''' when the player is in the [[Barbarian Faction]] will reward them with {{Reputation|Barbarian|25}}. If the player is in the [[Mage Faction]] and they kill a '''Krondor Necromancer''', they will lose {{Reputation|Mage|25}}.

== Behavior ==
When hostile, the '''Krondor Necromancer''' will begin to shoot fireballs towards the player every 3 seconds, which deal {{Stat|dmg|4,000}} on hit. If the player is close to the '''Krondor Necromancer''', it will begin to run towards the player, and shoot fireballs at a much higher rate.

== Trivia ==
'''Krondor Necromancer''' shares the same skin with the [[Mage Outlaw]].

